{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with unique mechanics and themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tutorial (Grass)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the starting area, which contains simple toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regions (Ruins)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Offsets (Snow)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Toros (Fall)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters in Toroban are called <i>toros</i>. There can be multiple toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combined (Desert)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the mechanics combine together in this area. Completely new kinds of puzzles emerge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced (Cosmic)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret mechanic is revealed, as well as more advanced overworld puzzles, and more advanced sub-puzzles.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1961850?t=1762404757","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/bf618b3f1b8a59af28818fd4bc0ded7a9150eb4e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762404757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/08bf0f6d547861d1603a4b3f0ca354eef5d394a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762404757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/08bf0f6d547861d1603a4b3f0ca354eef5d394a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762404757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toroban is an infinitely wrapping puzzle game. Explore a nonlinear overworld full of interconnected puzzles. There are various biomes to experience, each with unique mechanics and themes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tutorial (Grass)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the starting area, which contains simple toroidal puzzles with blocks, buttons, and gates. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Regions (Ruins)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls have crumbled in this area, allowing access to puzzles from the outside world. Objects can be transferred between puzzles. Players must alternate between activating the toroidal puzzles and interacting with the puzzles from the outside world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Offsets (Snow)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This area contains X and Y axis blocks, that when moved, shift the alignment of the toroidal grid.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Toros (Fall)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters in Toroban are called <i>toros</i>. There can be multiple toros in a puzzle, and this area explores the concepts of how they can work together to solve puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combined (Desert)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the mechanics combine together in this area. Completely new kinds of puzzles emerge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advanced (Cosmic)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret mechanic is revealed, as well as more advanced overworld puzzles, and more advanced sub-puzzles.</p>","developers":["Hebert Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961850/5460a1eab7f66c1be02b0a38f60ed62e18f6e041/header.jpg?t=1762404757","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04, Mint 22.2, Arch Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3, Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 760, 2GB VRAM, 16k texture support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> glibc &gt;= 2.39</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04, Mint 22.2, Arch Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3, Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 760, 2GB VRAM, 16k texture support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> glibc &gt;= 2.39</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961850/861455/33af51ce408d5554c7fc3aa5e6c2d5d874333940/1751061574/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743486933","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961850/861455/33af51ce408d5554c7fc3aa5e6c2d5d874333940/1751061574/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743486933","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961850/861455/33af51ce408d5554c7fc3aa5e6c2d5d874333940/1751061574/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743486933","id":257120828,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/s